    "body": "Correct. XHR might well be used as a template, so I figured it should also allow anything.\n\nNodes with a browsing context are not inert; `img` loads, `audio` plays and fires events, etc., so I think it makes sense to keep requirements there so a conformance checker integrated in a browser's devtools can point out mistakes.\n",
